new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..537c7adff7e9f1403adc059d30e816b157aafc05
--- /dev/null
+++ b/third_party/catapult/tracing/third_party/jszip/README.markdown
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+JSZip
+=====
+
+A library for creating, reading and editing .zip files with Javascript, with a
+lovely and simple API.
+
+See http://stuartk.com/jszip for all the documentation
+
+```javascript
+var zip = new JSZip();
+
+zip.file("Hello.txt", "Hello World\n");
+
+var img = zip.folder("images");
+img.file("smile.gif", imgData, {base64: true});
+
+var content = zip.generate();
+
+location.href = "data:application/zip;base64," + content;
+/*
+Results in a zip containing
+Hello.txt
+images/
+    smile.gif
+*/
+```
+
+License
+=======
+
+JSZip is dual-licensed. You may use it under the MIT license *or* the GPLv3
+license. See LICENSE.markdown.
